Third-party dependencies are not bundled in this repository; they are installed from
backend/requirements.txt and package.json under their own licences. Most are MIT, BSD, ISC or
Apache-2.0. Notable exceptions:

- psycopg / psycopg-binary: LGPL-3.0-only. Imported only when DATABASE_URL is set (PostgreSQL);
