- certifi: MPL-2.0.
- tqdm: MPL-2.0 AND MIT (a dependency of openai, pulled in when AGENT_BACKEND=openai).
- dompurify (via mermaid): MPL-2.0 OR Apache-2.0, used here under Apache-2.0.
- robust-predicates (via mermaid): Unlicense.
- caniuse-lite (via autoprefixer): CC-BY-4.0. Build-time only; not shipped in the app bundle.
